            "kind": "WakeflowImplementationTargetResultReport",
            "schemaVersion": 1,
            "outcome": "needs-review",
            "summary": "在 AlembicPlugin 仓库新建未跟踪文件 docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md，内容恰好两行 `# Wakeflow smoke round 6` 与 `round six verified`，每行一个 LF（44 字节，UTF-8，无 BOM），第二行是更正后的文字，没有使用被替代包中的旧第二行。写入前确认了基线：该路径不存在，不被 .gitignore 忽略，HEAD、全仓库与 docs/ 状态、前几轮四个文件都和任务包一致。文件用 `set -o noclobber` 加 `printf '%s\\n' '# Wakeflow smoke round 6' 'round six verified' >` 写入，避免覆盖和多余字符。十个验收锚点的只读核对全部符合预期（原始输出见 verification）。没有改动、移动或删除其他文件，没有补建第五轮的文件或 docs/archive/，没有 git add、提交、stash 或改动 HEAD/分支，也没有运行测试、构建或安装命令。本 Demand 尚无托管证据，按任务包以 needs-review 导入，anchorEvidence 与 evidenceLocators 为空；真实环境测试由 Controller 另行规划给 Test 窗口。",
            "repositoryChange": {
              "repositoryId": "repository_08d1b31f-1acb-4a71-bc23-e0d21b9822f1",
              "disposition": "left-uncommitted",
              "branch": "main",
              "commits": []
            },
            "evidenceLocators": [],
            "verification": [
              "基线（写入前）：`git status --porcelain` 与 `git status --porcelain docs/` 都输出四行 `?? docs/wakeflow-smoke-round2.md`、`?? docs/wakeflow-smoke-round3.md`、`?? docs/wakeflow-smoke-round4.md`、`?? docs/wakeflow-smoke.md`；`git rev-parse HEAD` 输出 `7b2c53aae21489d2daad651a0261d02c6d1bdd95`；`git symbolic-ref HEAD` 输出 `refs/heads/main`；`ls -la docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md` 输出 `No such file or directory`；`git check-ignore -v docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md` 没有输出，退出码 1（不被忽略）；`test -e docs/archive` 退出码 1；四个旧文件的字节数与 SHA-256 和任务包一致（见 ac-7 至 ac-10）。",
              "ac-1-regular-file：满足。`test -f docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md && test ! -L docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md; echo $?` 输出 `0`。",
              "ac-2-exact-bytes：满足。`wc -c < docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md` 输出 `      44`；`shasum -a 256 docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md` 输出 `87366ae7e04fbf5445e9330cdbc5130e112d2529bad638494bda3f4ec00566fd  docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md`；`printf '# Wakeflow smoke round 6\\nround six verified\\n' | cmp - docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md; echo $?` 没有差异输出，只输出 `0`；`od -c docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md` 输出：\n0000000    #       W   a   k   e   f   l   o   w       s   m   o   k   e\n0000020        r   o   u   n   d       6  \\n   r   o   u   n   d       s\n0000040    i   x       v   e   r   i   f   i   e   d  \\n\n0000054\n首字节是 `#`（无 BOM），恰好两个 `\\n`（第 25 个字节与最后一个字节），第二行是 `round six verified`。补充只读核对：`LC_ALL=C tr -dc '\\n' < docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md | wc -c` 输出 `       2`；`LC_ALL=C tr -dc '\\r' < docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md | wc -c` 输出 `       0`（没有 CR）；`grep -c 'resume relocate verified' docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md` 输出 `0`（没有旧第二行）；`grep -n ' $' docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md` 没有输出、退出码 1（没有尾随空格）。",
              "ac-3-docs-status-one-new-entry：满足。`git status --porcelain docs/` 恰好输出五行：\n?? docs/wakeflow-smoke-round2.md\n?? docs/wakeflow-smoke-round3.md\n?? docs/wakeflow-smoke-round4.md\n?? docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md\n?? docs/wakeflow-smoke.md\n相对基线四行只多出 `?? docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md`。",
              "ac-4-head-commit-unchanged：满足。`git rev-parse HEAD` 输出 `7b2c53aae21489d2daad651a0261d02c6d1bdd95`。",
              "ac-5-head-on-main：满足。`git symbolic-ref HEAD` 输出 `refs/heads/main`。",
              "ac-6-repo-status-matches-docs：满足。全仓库 `git status --porcelain` 输出与 ac-3 相同的五行：\n?? docs/wakeflow-smoke-round2.md\n?? docs/wakeflow-smoke-round3.md\n?? docs/wakeflow-smoke-round4.md\n?? docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md\n?? docs/wakeflow-smoke.md\n`diff <(git status --porcelain) <(git status --porcelain docs/)` 没有输出，退出码 0；`git diff --stat` 与 `git diff --cached --stat` 都没有输出，docs/ 之外没有任何新增、修改、删除或暂存条目。",
              "ac-7-round1-file-unchanged：满足。`wc -c < docs/wakeflow-smoke.md` 输出 `      31`；`shasum -a 256 docs/wakeflow-smoke.md` 输出 `953170c48b50a2ccf9e2925d073e1d4e9eb23c4d0715d76459f0d84b6888b4e3  docs/wakeflow-smoke.md`。",
              "ac-8-round2-file-unchanged：满足。`wc -c < docs/wakeflow-smoke-round2.md` 输出 `      28`；`shasum -a 256 docs/wakeflow-smoke-round2.md` 输出 `3b1b1f6b04588d2b8ab83de6bd9d1d13270aa82ffb4577da72c883a8e3a36b44  docs/wakeflow-smoke-round2.md`。",
              "ac-9-round3-file-unchanged：满足。`wc -c < docs/wakeflow-smoke-round3.md` 输出 `      28`；`shasum -a 256 docs/wakeflow-smoke-round3.md` 输出 `d1b808459e29a479884cf11b5c2769b2065fcff39873013fe653c01ad2402f9f  docs/wakeflow-smoke-round3.md`。",
              "ac-10-round4-file-unchanged：满足。`wc -c < docs/wakeflow-smoke-round4.md` 输出 `      28`；`shasum -a 256 docs/wakeflow-smoke-round4.md` 输出 `ab07de6de9c8f41807987303679af1265f72ab957c0fe40caa35bc391fe63961  docs/wakeflow-smoke-round4.md`。",
              "范围外未动：`test -e docs/archive` 与 `test -e docs/wakeflow-smoke-round5.md` 退出码都是 1，没有补建第五轮的文件或目录。"
            ],
